<main>
<h1 id="toc_1">Changelog</h1>
<h2 id="toc_2">2.1.0</h2>
<ul>
<li>Added <del>themes</del> <mark>theme packs</mark>.</li>
<li>Fixed H<sub>2</sub>O rendering, 2<sup>10</sup> pages.</li>
<li>Faster builds <sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref-1"><a href="#fn-1">1</a></sup>.</li>
</ul>
<h2 id="toc_3">2.0.0</h2>
<ol>
<li>Rewrote the core.</li>
<li>Dropped Python 3.7.</li>
</ol>
<hr />
<p>Older releases: see <a href="https://example.com/lumen/history">https://example.com/lumen/history</a>.</p>
<section class="footnotes">
<ol>
<li id="fn-1"><p>About 40% faster on large sites.<a href="#fnref-1" class="footnote">&#8617;</a></p></li>
</ol>
</section>
</main>
