<!doctype html>
<title>Usage</title>
<nav>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_1">Usage</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_2">Build</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_3">Serve</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</nav>
<main>
<h1 id="toc_1">Usage</h1>
<details class="toc" open>
<summary>Table of Contents</summary>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_1">Usage</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_2">Build</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_3">Serve</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_4">Options</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</details>
<h2 id="toc_2">Build</h2>
<p>Run <code>lumen build</code>. The output goes to <code>site/</code> by default; change it with
<code>--out</code>.</p>
<section class="admonition warning">
<p class="admonition-title">Warning</p>
<p>Building overwrites the output folder.</p>
</section>
<h2 id="toc_3">Serve</h2>
<p>Run <code>lumen serve</code> and open <a href="http://localhost:8000/">http://localhost:8000/</a>.
Back to the <a href="../index.md">index</a>.</p>
<h3 id="toc_4">Options</h3>
<dl>
<dt>Term</dt>
<dd>Meaning of the term.</dd>
<dt>Port</dt>
<dd>The port to listen on, <em>8000</em> by default.</dd>
</dl>
<blockquote>
<p>Included note: <em>see also</em> the <a href="../api.md">api</a>.</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="error"><pre>Could not include self: usage.md</pre></div>
</main>
== page index.md -> data/out/index.html (2995 bytes, 5 headings)
<!doctype html>
<title>Lumen documentation</title>
<nav>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_1">Lumen documentation</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_2">Getting started</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_3">Configuration</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_4">Examples</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_5">Checklist</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</nav>
<main>
<h1 id="toc_1">Lumen documentation</h1>
<p>Lumen is a static site toolkit. This page is the entry point.</p>
<details class="toc" open>
<summary>On this page</summary>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_1">Lumen documentation</a>
<ul>
<li><a href="#toc_2">Getting started</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_3">Configuration</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_4">Examples</a></li>
<li><a href="#toc_5">Checklist</a></li>
</ul>
</li>
</ul>
</details>
<h2 id="toc_2">Getting started</h2>
<p>Install Lumen with pip:</p>
<pre><code>pip install lumen</code></pre>
<p>Then check the version:</p>
<pre><code class="language-console">$ lumen --version
lumen 2.1.0
</code></pre>
<section class="admonition note tip-box">
<p class="admonition-title">Before you begin</p>
<p>You need Python 3.8 or later. See <a href="guide/usage.md">usage</a>.</p>
</section>
<h2 id="toc_3">Configuration</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
  <th style="text-align:left">Key</th>
  <th style="text-align:center">Default</th>
  <th style="text-align:right">Meaning</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
  <td style="text-align:left"><code>title</code></td>
  <td style="text-align:center"><em>none</em></td>
  <td style="text-align:right">Site title</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="text-align:left"><code>theme</code></td>
  <td style="text-align:center"><code>plain</code></td>
  <td style="text-align:right">Theme name</td>
</tr>
<tr>
  <td style="text-align:left"><code>out</code></td>
  <td style="text-align:center"><code>site/</code></td>
  <td style="text-align:right">Output folder</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<p>The defaults are fine for most sites.<sup class="footnote-ref" id="fnref-1"><a href="#fn-1">1</a></sup></p>
<h2 id="toc_4">Examples</h2>
<pre class="directive-include">
from lumen import build

build("docs", "site")
</pre>
<div class="banner">Lumen <b>2.1</b></div>

<figure class="figure align-center" style="width:60%">
<div class="block-image"><img src="/images/arch.png" /></div>
<figcaption>The build pipeline.</figcaption>
</figure>
<h2 id="toc_5">Checklist</h2>
<ul>
<li class="task-list-item"><input class="task-list-item-checkbox" type="checkbox" disabled checked/>write pages</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input class="task-list-item-checkbox" type="checkbox" disabled/>add search</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input class="task-list-item-checkbox" type="checkbox" disabled/>publish</li>
</ul>
<p>See the <a href="api.md">API reference</a>, the <a href="changelog.md">changelog</a> and the
<a href="guide/missing.md">missing page</a>.</p>
<section class="footnotes">
<ol>
<li id="fn-1"><p>They follow the conventions of other generators.<a href="#fnref-1" class="footnote">&#8617;</a></p></li>
</ol>
</section>
</main>
